OL,3,GNEWSA#6m bridge to spare commuters long
OL,4,Atrek up station ramp
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to #10m is going to be spent making
OL,7,Fit easier to get in and out of some
OL,8,FLancashire railway stations.
OL,10,FCommuters arriving at or leaving from a
OL,11,Fplatform at Burnley's Manchester Road
OL,12,Fstation currently find themselves
OL,13,Ffacing a trek up a very long ramp.
OL,15,FBut a bridge, which will have a lift to
OL,16,Ftake people up to it, is going to be
OL,17,Fput in at a cost of #6.4m.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
